sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent
    participant E as Workflow Engine
    participant H as Handler
    participant G as Approval Gate

    A->>E: run(workflow, input)
    E->>E: validate graph
    E->>H: classify
    H-->>E: classification
    E->>H: enrich
    H-->>E: context
    E->>H: plan
    H-->>E: plan
    E->>E: evaluate condition
    E->>G: approval required?
    alt approved
        E->>H: refund
        H-->>E: refund result
        E->>H: final_answer
    else not approved
        E-->>A: blocked
    end
    E-->>A: WorkflowRun + trace
